{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50638","headline":"题云居上寺 · 王潜","name":"题云居上寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万木千峯空鸟喧，潺潺[溪]水下长川。\n人来石室藏何处。\n一迳归时带暮烟。\n（见《金石萃编》卷一百五。\n）（〖1〗石刻诗次吉潜诗後。\n原题曰「同前」。\n下署「节度都巡使太常卿上柱国王潜」。\n第二句第三字原作「氵」，摩其右半，意者或爲「涧」字，或爲「流」字，虽然，未敢擅补也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}